## Design system

- **Fonts:** "Futura PT" family (Book, Medium, Demi). "Covered By Your Grace" for accent numbers/dates. Uppercase labels and CTAs common.
- **Account → Alerts** (`/account/notifications`, `src/pages/account/notifications/page.tsx`): each alert row uses **three** stacked text lines — **(1)** title: **black**, **Covered By Your Grace** (~14px, uppercase); **(2)** body line: **gray** (`#808080`), **Futura PT Demi** (~10px, uppercase); **(3)** action link: **red** (`#EB1C24`), **Futura PT Medium** (~10px, uppercase). Apply this pattern for **all** alerts going forward unless product asks otherwise.
- **Brand red:** `#EB1C24` — primary buttons, links, active states, key icons.
- **Backgrounds:** Marble texture (`/assets/marble-half.png`), white/translucent cards (`bg-white/60`, `backdrop-blur-sm`), borders often `1.3px solid black` or `1.3px solid #9ca3af` (gray).
- **Icons:** SVGs in `public/assets/` (e.g. `special-offer.svg`, `slay-challenge.svg`, `Free Gift.svg`). Use `<img src="/assets/...">` with red filter when they should match brand red.
- **Brand Bible (creative constitution):** **`brand-bible/`** — production handbook (philosophy + standards), not marketing or prompts. **Supreme creative law:** **`brand-bible/frontal-slayer-north-star-manifesto.md`**. **`brand-bible/MASTER_ROADMAP.md`** is the TOC, phased registry, folder architecture, and governance plan. Shipped L0 docs: **`visual-language/visual-language.md`**, **`storytelling/storytelling-philosophy.md`**, **`psa/identity.md`**, **`psa/design-principles.md`**. Operational execution bibles stay under **`docs/frontal-slayer/`** (linked from roadmap, not duplicated). Model prompts stay **`motherboard/golden-prompts/`** — governed by future **`brand-bible/ai-systems/generation-governance.md`**.
- **Layout:** Mobile-first; shared nav with back/menu, breadcrumb-style text (e.g. `ACCOUNT > CONCIERGE`), cart icon, dynamic cart count from localStorage / events.
- **Frontal Slayer Motion System (FSMS):** Official reusable motion language at **`src/motion/`** — React 19 + Framer Motion + CSS variables; crystal acrylic typography (`CrystalTitle`, `CrystalSubtitle`, `CrystalLogo`), lighting engine (`LightSweep`, `SparkleSystem`), scene primitives (`SceneIntro`, `SceneOutro`, `TransitionLayer`), seven presets (`luxury-reveal`, `morning-reveal`, etc.). Import from **`@/motion`** or **`src/motion`**. No bounce/elastic; `prefers-reduced-motion` respected. Styles auto-load via `src/motion/index.ts`.
- **Frontal Slayer Design System (FDS):** Official visual DNA at **`src/design-system/`** — semantic color tokens (CSS variables, brand red `#EB1C24`), 8-point spacing, typography presets (Display XL → Legal), glassmorphism components, button/card/panel systems, forms, icon wrapper, responsive layouts. Import from **`@/design-system`** or **`src/design-system`**. Never hardcode colors/spacing — inherit tokens. Styles auto-load via `src/design-system/index.ts`. Pairs with FSMS for motion.
- **Frontal Slayer Cinematic System (FSCS):** Official cinematic language at **`src/cinematic/`** — camera presets (Drone Push, Slow Push, Orbit, Architectural Reveal, etc.), shot library, transitions (mapped to FSMS), timeline presets (30s/60s/90s commercial, reel, documentary), story rhythm + campaign beats, audio cue markers, scene templates, titles/overlays (FSMS integration). Import from **`@/cinematic`**. Not a video player — creative blueprint for films, campaigns, and immersive experiences.
- **Shop / product nav search:** Many storefront pages use **`useShopNavSearchBar`** (`src/components/shop/useShopNavSearchBar.tsx`) built on **`useSiteNavSearch`** (`src/hooks/useSiteNavSearch.ts`). Tapping the magnifier opens a **left-aligned** red **Futura PT Medium** **`?q=`** search field **in place of** the breadcrumb (placeholder + typed text **`#EB1C24`** via **`.site-nav-search-input`**). **Enter** navigates to **`/home/shop?q=...`** (`shopProductSearchHref`). **`src/utils/shopProductSearch.ts`** — intelligent BAW + unit + **gift card** matching (`GIFT_CARD_BALANCE_OPTIONS`); **`ShopSearchResultsGrid`** renders **`/units/straight`** staggered marble cards (wig units + gift cards with **DIGITAL ONLY** line). Non-matching products omitted; crumb **SHOP > SEARCH** when results show.

