- **Studio OS application layer (2026-07-05):** Studio OS is the standalone product; **Frontal Slayer is one organization**. Hierarchy: **Studio OS → Workspace Registry → Organizations**. Code: **`src/studio-os-core/application/`**, **`auth/`**, **`feature-inheritance/`**, **`tenant/isolation.ts`**, **`workspace/headquarters-module-resolver.ts`**. **Frontal Slayer admin** → **HEADQUARTERS** card (`/admin/headquarters`); **Studio Administration** (`/admin/studio-os/administration`) portfolio owners only — **`StudioAdministrationGuard`**, **`StudioWorkspaceGuard`**, Supabase **`studio_os_org_memberships`**, **`GET /api/admin/studio-os-membership`**. Legacy **`/admin/studio/*`** = Frontal Slayer HQ aliases only. **Browser storage (2026-07-06):** **`src/utils/studioOsBrowserStorage.ts`** — lightweight prefs in localStorage only; large demo/module payloads in session memory; user edits via **`studio_os_workspace_state`** + **`/api/admin/studio-workspace-state`**; **`resetLocalStudioCache()`** recovery. See **`docs/studio-os/architecture.md`**.
