- **Prompt Registry™ (M133 V1.0 — 2026-07-06):** **Centralized AI prompt management** — every prompt, instruction set, system prompt, workflow prompt, and reasoning template registered as first-class platform asset; full metadata; version history (compare, restore, test, approve — nothing overwritten); Prompt Testing (quality, consistency, latency, cost, tokens, hallucination risk, trust compliance); registration gate (`canPromptExecute`); Command Dock query/compare/test. Core: **`src/studio-os-core/prompt-registry/`** · UI **`/admin/studio/prompt-registry`** · **`MissionControlPromptRegistryPanel`**. Sync: Automation Registry → Prompt Registry. Brand voice: *"Prompts are code. AI behavior stays transparent, maintainable, and continuously improving."* Docs: **`docs/studio-os/prompt-registry.md`** · localStorage `studioOsPromptRegistry_v1`.
- **Policy Engine™ (M134 V1.0 — 2026-07-06):** **Centralized organizational rulebook** — define policies once; every Concierge, automation, workflow, and department follows automatically; layered hierarchy (platform → organization → department → team → individual); enforcement gate (`verifyWorkflowCompliance` · `canWorkflowExecute`); policy simulation before publishing; Command Dock block/explain/simulate queries. Core: **`src/studio-os-core/policy-engine/`** · UI **`/admin/studio/policy-engine`** · **`MissionControlPolicyEnginePanel`**. Sync: Prompt Registry → Policy Engine. Brand voice: *"Define policies once. Every system follows organizational law automatically."* Docs: **`docs/studio-os/policy-engine.md`** · localStorage `studioOsPolicyEngine_v1`.
