## 2026-10-07 — Migration authority recovery (Opus) + founder icon sheet

- **Context:** Sprint P0.AIO.CLIENT-MIGRATION.OPUS-AUTHORITY-IMPLEMENTATION-RECOVERY1. The live migration screens (from PR #47) were rejected: "KEEP THE FUNCTION. REBUILD THE LOOK." Approved images in `AIO_CLIENT_MIGRATION_AUTHORITY/` are design authority and were not changed. Earlier in this chat: IFTA V2 was redone as a fine-tune of V1 with the composition locked, and an uppercase + light-ground footer lockup patch was added (docs only).
