- **Shipped:** Recovery commit f34589c3 on `opus/aio-client-migration-authority-recovery1`. The founder chose to merge, so it landed on master via `[sync-only]` merge 640c7e22 (Vercel skipped). The founder's preview screenshot had shown the pre-recovery master.
