- **Build:** `npm run migration:prototype` → `.migration-mocks/aio-migration-flow.html` (~7.7 MB). Files: `prototype/migration-app.html`, `src/prototype/migrationFlowPrototype.tsx`, `scripts/migration/build-flow-prototype.mjs`, `scripts/migration/flow-prototype-template.html`, `scripts/migration/migration-screens.d.mts`. No product code changed.
- **Frame shims (prototype only):** localStorage falls back to memory; the invite request is answered locally and the email lands in the outbox (link path only, because a srcdoc frame's origin is "null"); `/migration/*` images map to packed data URIs through `setAttribute` (case-insensitive, React writes `srcSet`) and the `img/source` `src`/`srcset` setters (React 19 re-assigns `img.src` on mount); `history.replaceState/pushState` keep only the fragment (`about:srcdoc#…`), since a relative `#step` resolves against the parent page.
