- **Gaps found while wiring (listed in the artifact, not fixed):** no authority screen for accepting the invite (set password); invite copy says no password while the activation page asks for one; the existing-client invite link is never clickable for staff; START MIGRATION ignores the highlighted path card; FOUNDER REVIEW's CONTINUE TO APPROVAL opens ITEMS NEEDING REVIEW; staff never see the client finish; BATCH COMPLETE rows show chevrons but do nothing.

